class="language-python"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0A1A7;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#7F848E;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;"># 打印窗口前3层控件结构，用于查看控件名称、类型和层级关系</span></span>
